# Canonical host is the apex. https://www.loansflow.loan/ was serving a
# byte-identical copy of the apex (no redirect), so every page was reachable
# on two hosts.
https://www.loansflow.loan/* https://loansflow.loan/:splat 301
# The old multi-step calculator wizard was replaced by per-loan calculators.
/tools /loans/ 301
/tools/ /loans/ 301
/tools/* /loans/ 301
/calculators /loans/ 301
